Hyprspace patches (niri/umbriel-style overview), all opt-in except the click/scroll fixes:
- plugin:overview:vertical = 1: workspaces stacked top to bottom in a full-height panel on the
  left that slides in from the left edge; panelHeight becomes its width; vertical scrolling pans it.
- plugin:overview:fitWorkspaces = 1: each workspace preview is shrunk to show all its windows,
  including off-screen columns of the scrolling layout.
- Clicking a window preview switches to its workspace, focuses it and closes the overview.
- A short click on a window in the main area focuses it before closing (was: close only).
- Horizontal scrolling over the main area moves the scrolling strip one column at a time.

